[{"client_msg_id":"e9822edb-df56-464a-b272-18285c61c555","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"サー・ロード・ベーデン・パウエル・オブ・ギルウェルで\nギルウェル卿だったかな","ts":"1625547143.291000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xkykh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18480e6b-9755-41c5-a968-2e9b2d22f014","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"爵位持ちなんで名前に Sir付ける","ts":"1625547074.289800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Rqyu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30e4b8fe-0a1d-4565-b204-1031633ca7f0","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"私がSirと聞いて一番先に出るのはボーイスカウトの創始者ですね","ts":"1625547033.289100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IV1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d97efccb-8ca3-48c0-87b0-e61388d11ca9","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"\u003chttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=05RA2q2mYYo\u003e","ts":"1625543869.288300","attachments":[{"fallback":"YouTube Video: 「英語には敬語がない」は大ウソ！","id":1,"author_name":"Kevin's English Room / 掛山ケビ志郎","author_link":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFbp2XdRpKfk7mYt_uT8dxw","title":"「英語には敬語がない」は大ウソ！","title_link":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=05RA2q2mYYo","thumb_url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/05RA2q2mYYo/hqdefault.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"YouTube","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/youtube.png","thumb_width":480,"thumb_height":360,"video_html":"\u003ciframe width=\"400\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/05RA2q2mYYo?feature=oembed\u0026autoplay=1\u0026iv_load_policy=3\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","video_html_width":400,"video_html_height":225,"from_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=05RA2q2mYYo","original_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=05RA2q2mYYo"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sMWu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"515ab2d6-02f0-4d07-a74e-651cc136e631","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"敬語ですね","ts":"1625543850.288100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iDSw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"855C2A34-6520-485F-BF68-44F28AC0090C","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"友達の奥さんが Sir つけるから、たぶん敬語なんだと思う","ts":"1625543163.287800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["UEACRCY0Z","UDDCM376D"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oeynl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b86a5ba8-cedc-44ad-8280-5e39f68b6968","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"軽い使い方だと旦那とか大将みたいなノリなんかな","ts":"1625541856.287000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f0u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ded27898-bfad-461c-851d-4c044096903f","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"なんか良いところのホテルマンがよく使う表現なんですね＞ Good morning, sir","ts":"1625541766.286300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AHk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d188240-567b-4c3b-ad68-f793cfd1c0fe","type":"message","user":"UEACRCY0Z","text":"そういや、元同僚のマケドニア人は同僚に「Good morning, sir」とか言ってましたね\nまあ、日本語でも同僚にジョークで「〇〇先生」とかいう表現を使ったりする人ではあるので、どこまで一般的かは知らないですが","ts":"1625540570.284500","thread_ts":"1625540570.284500","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BsVs="}]},{"client_msg_id":"762aae49-bee6-4cb5-8346-59584f9f6e22","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"まあみんなそれぞれ「私はこう思っています/感じています」という話をしているだけなので、誰が正しいと言う話ではないですねー\n長文に強いと言うのは知らなかったので、今度機会があったら試してみようと思います :kan::sha:","ts":"1625534337.281700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LfF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2416b4e6-08be-4a67-bcc9-980d631bb0ff","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私は1文ずつ翻訳することが多いんですよね。長文を入れることがほぼないです。この使い方だとどうやら DeepL との相性は悪いみたいですね。他の翻訳に比べるとおかしな訳が返ってくる率が高い印象があります。あくまで個人的な経験に基づく印象になるので、客観的にどうという話ではないです。","ts":"1625534159.280300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"++iK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af2bd173-e538-4052-b13f-c16267c44956","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"まあもちろん文脈さえちゃんと書けば良い訳を出してくれる、という保証はありませんが、DeepLは他の翻訳に比べると善戦してくれてるという印象です","ts":"1625533832.278700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=4C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83a6331e-bce4-4a9e-b167-18bb89d32a09","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"多分どのツールでも、まともな訳をもらおうと思ったら文脈をうまいこと入れてあげる工夫は必要だと思います。\n技術的な質問するとき、環境とかエラーの詳細とかの周辺状況も含めて伝えたほうが良い返事をもらいやすいですよね。あれと同じだと思ってます","ts":"1625533756.277000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fh4h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ed54168-d553-48d0-a450-e0ad6572f0d3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なるほど、長文を訳したことがなかったので印象が違うんですねーたぶん\n逆に言うと短文を訳す場合は DeepL は使わない方がよさそうですね","ts":"1625533312.274100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z94zP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3293fef5-a8dd-43bd-97e2-488755d73392","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"「おはようございます」で翻訳精度は測れないと思います。「誰が」「誰に向けて」言ったのか、という情報が欠落しているから。\n訳が揺れるのは DeepL の問題ではありません。本質的に打った人が何を期待しているか当てるゲーム要素をはらんでいるタスクです。\n強いて言うなら、DeepL の場合は複数候補出してくれるので比較的親切ですね","ts":"1625520871.269600","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1625521153.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2zFbW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63DDF174-5DD6-43D2-9286-1300735908CC","type":"message","user":"U022TD5GGKE","text":"deepl翻訳は短い文章ほどポンコツな感じはしますね\n硬めの英語長文を食わせると読みやすい自然な日本語出してくれてすごく便利って感じ。機械学習というかcontext awarenessというか。","ts":"1625503535.258400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oV0u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06C39833-5EE6-4868-AFE9-EBA4093BD61F","type":"message","user":"U022TD5GGKE","text":"DeepLとGrammarlyは課金して使ってます。便利。","ts":"1625502804.253200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J03EQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e58806f0-e3bc-4762-8235-312515c035fc","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"難しすぎるw","ts":"1625502574.251900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gM3Kk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e62ecbc-8fb6-42bc-93df-5e608e8d390d","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"「おはようございます。」（最後に「。」をつける）にすると Good morning. になる。","ts":"1625502534.251700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":3,"users":["UG6DF6W87","U022TD5GGKE","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uGUl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72670a08-a3f6-4fc0-bfa4-81af69b16a79","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あと結局翻訳かけて英語も読むからわけわからんのは読み飛ばしてるかも...\n翻訳(日本語訳)はコンテキストを踏まえて自動でひいてくれる単語帳...","ts":"1625501621.250600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/ysN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"867d21d9-9556-465c-95d8-3d006e180a2f","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"かたいというか修飾がシンプルな、か","ts":"1625501403.246400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bQyly"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89279ad8-6064-4148-a402-03039e317d1c","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"私は割とかたい英語ばかり投げつけるので、そこまで壊れて出てくるの出会わないですね、どのサービスでも\n自分でかんがえたぶっ壊れ英語投げるとぶっ壊れ日本語返されますけどw","ts":"1625501248.244200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yIuN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38f66c8c-1ab7-4d80-be89-e488b7dc3c80","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ちなみに DeepL の変な結果を引く経験はだいたい日本語の結果だったりします(英語は間違ってるか判断できないだけ)。そもそも日本語になってないやつとかが出てくる…","ts":"1625500491.240400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X7l/S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a535c3e3-91af-4aba-b054-2ac3ea88c64d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"英語何もわからない…機械翻訳の結果(英語)が明らかに変だろこれと思ったら正しいと言うパターンはやっぱりあるのか","ts":"1625500433.239300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YRq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b17bc72a-98a3-4078-8549-385cf8c97688","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"\u003chttps://ejje-weblio-jp.cdn.ampproject.org/v/s/ejje.weblio.jp/content/amp/sir?amp_js_v=a6\u0026amp_gsa=1\u0026amp;usqp=mq331AQKKAFQArABIIACAw%3D%3D#aoh=16255002312528\u0026amp;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com\u0026amp_tf=%E3%82%BD%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B9%3A%20%251%24s\u0026ampshare=https%3A%2F%2Fejje.weblio.jp%2Fcontent%2Fsir|https://ejje-weblio-jp.cdn.ampproject.org/v/s/ejje.weblio.jp/content/amp/sir?amp_js_v=a6\u0026amp_gsa=1\u0026amp;usqp=mq331AQKKAFQArABIIACAw%3D%3D#aoh=16255002312528\u0026amp;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com\u0026amp_tf=%E3%82%BD%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B9%3A%20%251%24s\u0026ampshare=https%3A%2F%2Fejje.weblio.jp%2Fcontent%2Fsir\u003e\nNo, sir. がアメリカ英語で性別に依らず使えそうなの知らなかった...","ts":"1625500360.238600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U022TD5GGKE"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"73LXw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7424128-77d3-4db3-b1a4-cfc76e44156a","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"直接的な訳がほしいときとある程度の意訳がほしいときで使い分けというか両方で訳したりしますね","ts":"1625500220.236800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AuK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5f9e13c-24c8-4af9-b65f-8bbe2573e9e3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私はまだ Google 先生の方を信用していますね、今のところは…","ts":"1625500131.235100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KK0j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e3747af-d7af-4d59-9776-724b8a6a4abf","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"今日誰の意見だったか忘れたけどGoogle先生の方が素直な答え出るので信用できるみたいなツイート見ましたね","ts":"1625500108.234700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2kg8y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de7ce4ce-2b5c-4431-8b0a-860d337bcda9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"DeepL たまに使うんですど、他の機械翻訳と比べると変な結果を引く経験の方が圧倒的に多くて、個人的にあんまり信用してないんですよねぇ","ts":"1625500053.233200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JBA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"953e23f8-3315-45c8-a294-c6cfd540edb6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"「お、食った文章でよく出てくるということはこれが普通なんだな、 :yoshi: 」","ts":"1625499972.232100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qfy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66b3e7bd-5e74-47df-b5cc-73406b1d235d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"機械学習って結局エビデンスの塊でしかなくて普通はどうみたいな判断をしてるわけじゃないですからねー","ts":"1625499944.230800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IDhk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2dbb963f-403a-43a1-ae39-1a91e4e63713","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"性別依存がある表現っぽいのでコンテキストなしで出てくるのもまたアレだな、と言う感じはちょっとあるが","ts":"1625499860.228500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kbj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4422727d-e351-4ce0-9199-00cc319af025","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"たとえば執事とかはこの挨拶してもおかしくなさそう","ts":"1625499848.228000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7tc0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b79903b-2a36-4abf-843a-c12fdcc35b09","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ネイティブみな、は正しくなさそう?","ts":"1625499833.227300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZZszw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5af4d5b-9b59-448e-92cc-7461bac5d5b6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CS1NKB9B2/p1625499262211700\u003e これが正解だったってこと?","ts":"1625499745.224800","attachments":[{"fallback":"[July 5th, 2021 8:34 AM] thinca: あ、もしかして私が知らないだけでネイティブの人は日常の挨拶で sir 使ってるの?","id":1,"author_id":"U03C71D7H","author_name":"thinca","author_subname":"thinca","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U03C71D7H","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2015-01-15/3417067010_04a676b32692fb2507e1_48.jpg","text":"あ、もしかして私が知らないだけでネイティブの人は日常の挨拶で sir 使ってるの?","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #english","ts":1625499262.211700,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CS1NKB9B2/p1625499262211700","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CS1NKB9B2/p1625499262211700"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CU+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ffb56ed-1e44-412d-80f6-7d3ebbb10ba5","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あーつまりスラング?","ts":"1625499722.224400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qNcb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec39b2e3-a22a-4c41-a795-a377432ab7d7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"だいぶフォーマルな表現らしい \u003chttps://kotanglish.jp/1869|https://kotanglish.jp/1869\u003e","ts":"1625499672.222300","attachments":[{"fallback":"KOTANGLISH: 朝のあいさつ、「Good morning」だけでは物足りない！ | KOTANGLISH | 日本ワーキングホリデー協会","id":1,"title":"朝のあいさつ、「Good morning」だけでは物足りない！ | KOTANGLISH | 日本ワーキングホリデー協会","title_link":"https://kotanglish.jp/1869","text":"朝の挨拶は「Good Morning」に、もう一言つけ加えるだけでより言葉の印象を良くすることができるんです！","image_url":"http://www.kotanglish.jp/wp-content/plugins/all-in-one-seo-pack/images/default-user-image.png","blocks":null,"ts":1459188941,"service_name":"KOTANGLISH","from_url":"https://kotanglish.jp/1869","original_url":"https://kotanglish.jp/1869"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L1m+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"286ffe49-a89b-4f72-bde0-804bf90356f9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"結局結果は信用するなってことですよねぇ。これは DeepL に限らず","ts":"1625499667.222100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vOg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f397c8e3-c0b0-477e-8d25-79672376dc99","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"どんなロジックで翻訳してるかはこの際どうでもよくて、「おはようございます」の翻訳結果が自然な結果にならないなって話をしたんですが、その結果も自然ですと言われると、うーん? となってしまう","ts":"1625499582.221300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U9S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a27b9d2-2f5f-41e6-87e3-66084b5f9b69","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"いやぁ、コンテキストが増えれば増えるほど安定すると思ってるので、その一文だけを見て、精度についての何かしらの判断はしないかなって思ってるだけです","ts":"1625499581.221200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qYfJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d70983ad-d95d-498c-a212-aae93b4488d9","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"割と変な意味で飜訳されることがあるので鵜呑みにするなという話なら見た","ts":"1625499552.219800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UFqP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"481a95f1-4995-4c36-aaac-b49554e2dec6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"機械学習を神聖視してないですかね","ts":"1625499505.217400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HiCbh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"793f9c83-1305-41d8-bd48-fc03335fef52","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"スラングの可能性","ts":"1625499492.217100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M3D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0ba02c9-eb41-4185-b888-6abedab6f55d","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"それは学習の精度の問題であって、不自然な訳ばかり返すやつ、とは思えないですね","ts":"1625499482.216900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GfAfl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d39fbe9-e12d-4f6c-b2ca-51bb52f2401f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"「ありうる」だけで言うと割と何でも、へんてこな訳でもあり得るならいいだろって話になっちゃうんですよね","ts":"1625499467.216400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5K4ky"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a393788-438c-4e54-b62a-84852270e43f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"コンテキスト特になしで「おはようございます」を英語にしてくださいって言われて sir を付ける翻訳者何人くらいいるんだろう","ts":"1625499397.214700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zP3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff83d6e0-da83-4722-b16e-7eaaa017a28f","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ありうる訳とは思います","ts":"1625499376.214200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"symF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f50d272c-7642-41f6-a06b-20c72782984f","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"うーん、それはあまりにコンテキストに依りませんか","ts":"1625499360.213600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xqgU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de9f1b1d-43db-4896-9823-0b9eb399d52c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"人間が訳したらこうはならないと思うんですよね","ts":"1625499327.212900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PHJMp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46bd375a-55ab-4db8-b8a0-fa19873a3a02","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"おはよう と おはようございます を明確に区別しようとしてるって意味で\nまぁ残念ながら丁寧さが行き過ぎてしまってるようには思いますが","ts":"1625499288.212500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iY0W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0cee2798-9761-446c-8be5-35d938b39f7c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あ、もしかして私が知らないだけでネイティブの人は日常の挨拶で sir 使ってるの?","ts":"1625499262.211700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e9Kee"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa711f6b-9214-4197-b376-2130d8dcc226","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"それこそ自然に翻訳するようにしようとしてる現れでは?","ts":"1625499208.210000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"586+Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15fd574b-c7c1-4be2-982d-3a10b3374f75","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"おはようございますに sir を付けてくる機械翻訳、他に見たことないんですよねぇ。独特すぎる…","ts":"1625499046.209200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MA=j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5fb5c1d8-24bd-4adc-9b5d-4b4154ff853f","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"私は自動翻訳の中では一番ぐらいの勢いで信頼してますね。英語の自然さは全くわからないけど、和訳のときには割とヒトが訳したのかってぐらい自然な訳が出てくるので。","ts":"1625498861.208600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+/h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3dd98ae-89cb-441f-9259-9098e7bfb3c0","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u003chttps://www.deepl.com/translator#ja/en/%E3%81%8A%E3%81%AF%E3%82%88%E3%81%86%E3%81%94%E3%81%96%E3%81%84%E3%81%BE%E3%81%99\u003e\n\u0026gt; おはようございます → Good morning, sir.\nDeepL ってあんまり自然な翻訳はしない印象がある…","ts":"1625497505.207900","attachments":[{"fallback":"DeepL Translate: The world's most accurate tran